# The busybox applets the installer initramfs links into /bin, one per
# line; the initramfs build makes /bin/<applet> -> busybox for each. This
# busybox has no SH_STANDALONE, so an applet without its link is "not
# found", and init cannot tell: without od the rescue menu never reads a
# key. tests/test_installer_init.sh runs init with only these on PATH.
sh
ash
echo
cat
ls
mkdir
rm
mv
cp
ln
sleep
sync
md5sum
mount
umount
reboot
poweroff
dmesg
head
tail
grep
sed
tr
test
true
false
printf
date
df
dd
od
stat
find
timeout
